  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#966;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#966;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
