  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>cot</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#966;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#966;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, given <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, we get,<br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#966;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#966;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#966;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#966;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#966;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>from</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>iv</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></math><br />But,&nbsp;<math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>&#966;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#966;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
